{
  "title": "Optimize your terminal setup",
  "date": "",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "English"
    },
    {
      "type": "h1",
      "text": "Optimize your terminal setup"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Claude Code works best when your terminal is properly configured. Follow these guidelines to optimize your experience."
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Themes and appearance"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Line breaks"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**Quick escape**: Type `\\` followed by Enter to create a newline"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**Keyboard shortcut**: Set up a keybinding to insert a newline"
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Set up Shift+Enter (VS Code or iTerm2):"
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Set up Option+Enter (VS Code, iTerm2 or macOS Terminal.app):"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Open Settings → Profiles → Keyboard"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Check “Use Option as Meta Key”"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Open Settings → Profiles → Keys"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Under General, set Left/Right Option key to “Esc+“"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Notification setup"
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "iTerm 2 system notifications"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Open iTerm 2 Preferences"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Navigate to Profiles → Terminal"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Enable “Silence bell” and Filter Alerts → “Send escape sequence-generated alerts”"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Set your preferred notification delay"
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Custom notification hooks"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Handling large inputs"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**Avoid direct pasting**: Claude Code may struggle with very long pasted content"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**Use file-based workflows**: Write content to a file and ask Claude to read it"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "**Be aware of VS Code limitations**: The VS Code terminal is particularly prone to truncating long pastes"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Vim Mode"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Mode switching: `Esc` (to NORMAL), `i`/`I`, `a`/`A`, `o`/`O` (to INSERT)"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Navigation: `h`/`j`/`k`/`l`, `w`/`e`/`b`, `0`/`$`/`^`, `gg`/`G`"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Editing: `x`, `dw`/`de`/`db`/`dd`/`D`, `cw`/`ce`/`cb`/`cc`/`C`, `.` (repeat)"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Was this page helpful?"
    }
  ]
}